 Final Numbers: U.S. IPOs 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data through Aug. 21, 2026. Source: Renaissance Capital The U.S. IPO market is in the midst of a record-breaking year, having generated more proceeds than in 2021, mostly attributed to SpaceX , per Renaissance Capital.

 Soon it will become a record-smashing year, as Anthropic is expected to flip its S-1 within weeks. OpenAI, meanwhile, reportedly told employees that it "will be a public company in 2027," but that the IPO could come in 2026 if "our business continues to inflect." 
 
